  "system": {
    "localizationKey": "",
    "description": "<p>Cancels any spell, with a chance of 90%, 70%, 40% or 15% depending on its tier. A few, such as Magic shield, cannot be cancelled.</p><p>Alternatively it disrupts an ongoing cast, adding a 40 point negative penalty to that spell's Difficulty and a 1% negative penalty to its Critical Failure chance.</p><p>If the disrupted cast ends in a Critical Failure, the caster may reduce its severity to any lower tier.</p><p>Always destabilizes portals. Can be cast as a Reaction on any spell within range.</p>",
